    "## New: market sentiment\n",
    "\n",
    "This tool is different from the others in one important way: it makes its\n",
    "own separate LLM call inside the tool itself, using a plain model with no\n",
    "tools bound to it, purely to classify the tone of a handful of recent\n",
    "headlines. This keeps that classification step isolated from the main\n",
    "conversational model, so it cannot get confused about whether it is\n",
    "answering the user or scoring an article."
   ]
  },
  {
   "cell_type": "code",
   "execution_count": 56,
   "id": "564af91d",
   "metadata": {},
   "outputs": [
    {
     "data": {
