       "'Sentiment for Tesla: Mixed\\nThe headlines primarily consist of neutral stock price updates and performance summaries, with occasional positive notes on gains, leading to an overall mixed market sentiment.\\n\\nBased on these recent headlines:\\n- Tesla: TSLA Stock Price Quote & News | Robinhood (https://robinhood.com/us/en/stocks/TSLA)\\n- Tesla Stock Price | TSLA Stock Quote, News, and History (https://markets.businessinsider.com/stocks/tsla-stock)\\n- Tesla Stock Scoreboard - Investing.com (https://www.investing.com/equities/tesla-motors-scoreboard)\\n- Tesla, Inc. (TSLA) Latest Stock News & Headlines - Yahoo Finance (https://finance.yahoo.com/quote/TSLA/news)'"
      ]
